# Vulnerabilities the image scan (.github/workflows/images.yml) may skip.
# Each entry needs a reason and an expiry date, so it gets looked at again:
#
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
# (reason: why it doesn't apply or why it can't be fixed yet)

CVE-2023-54404 exp:2026-12-31
# zod 4.4.3 in marimo's bundled Copilot language server, a Node.js program that
# only `marimo edit` starts. The image runs `marimo run` and has no Node.js, so
# the code cannot run. The CVE is a memory exhaustion (availability only).
# marimo 0.25.2 is the newest release and still bundles it.
